analysis_gcogni/

# ── local-only research + training tooling ───────────────────────────────────
# Kept on disk and in the private repo; deliberately not published. The salience
# head / supersession cross-encoder training pipeline, corpus generation and
# mining, ONNX export, and the eval + measurement harnesses are dev-environment
# methodology, not part of the shipped package (the wheel contains only
# src/cognikernel — no scripts/, no docs/).
#
# The cognikernel_*_hook.py shims are the exception and stay tracked: two
# integration tests spawn them to validate the real hook pipeline end to end.
scripts/*
!scripts/cognikernel_*_hook.py

# Research write-ups: plans, specs, and measurement output.
docs/superpowers/
docs/metrics/
